cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-loader-xlsx in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-loader-xlsx: Excel workbooks as input to ISO 20022 pain.001"
abstract: >-
  A loader plugin for the pain001 library that reads payment batches
  directly from .xlsx and .xlsm workbooks, with a type guard against
  numeric-IBAN corruption and streaming for large batches.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.70"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/pain001-loader-xlsx"
url: "https://pain001.com"
keywords:
  - ISO 20022
  - pain.001
  - Excel
  - xlsx
  - payments
